<p>round rugby union matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Gloucester	 18  Bristol     12</p>
<p> London Scottish  15  Newcastle   39</p>
<p> Northampton	26  Coventry    17</p>
<p> Orrell		0  Sale	  57</p>
<p> Rotherham	  23  Harlequins  42</p>
<p> Wakefield	  24  Moseley     14</p>
